OL,3,ASecurity lapses at Utah campus where
OL,4,ACharlie Kirk was killed, review says
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt also said that Kirk's aides had
OL,7,Finsisted on a outdoor venue, overriding
OL,8,Fsecurity concerns from campus
OL,9,Fofficials, who then failed to properly
OL,10,Fassess the dangers.
OL,12,FThe 31-year-old activist had been
OL,13,Faddressing thousands of people in an
OL,14,FOrem campus courtyard when he was shot
OL,15,Ffrom a nearby rooftop on 10 September
OL,16,F2025.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
